{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as Vanessa, a woman trapped in a wheelchair, trying to escape a collapsing hospital in the decaying city of Uroko \u2014 a place where local myths and distorted memories bleed into reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Movement follows the classic tank-style controls, reimagined to convey the weight and precision of a wheelchair. Every turn, obstacle, and delayed reaction becomes part of the experience \u2014 not a limitation, but a mechanic of fear. The challenge is physical, emotional, and deeply psychological.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/95c9b90e7b1631d0df2ebe175dd5f24a.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/95c9b90e7b1631d0df2ebe175dd5f24a.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/95c9b90e7b1631d0df2ebe175dd5f24a.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Vanessa will need to solve puzzles and secrets in order to advance<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/e3c5be490618b96fe851a3e41fb60082.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/e3c5be490618b96fe851a3e41fb60082.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/e3c5be490618b96fe851a3e41fb60082.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Vanessa explores the dark corridors, she finds weapons and scarce resources, managing a limited inventory that forces difficult decisions between defense and survival.<br>The entities that haunt Uroko are inspired by Japanese folklore and traditional theater, their slow gestures, deformed masks, and ritualistic movements echoing Noh and Kabuki \u2014 art forms that dwell on guilt, regret, and spiritual transgression.<br><br>While struggling to survive, Vanessa uncovers fragments of memories, records, and symbols, questioning her own role in the tragedy.<br>Is she a victim of Uroko\u2019s curse \u2014 or the reason it fell apart?","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263260?t=1761324495","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263260?t=1761324495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/2985e9d9f5e2c69c6ad06ef262908ba47f6c1e71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761324495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/2985e9d9f5e2c69c6ad06ef262908ba47f6c1e71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761324495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/7437e4f0937b21f47a3153067fb55d40.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as Vanessa, a woman trapped in a wheelchair, trying to escape a collapsing hospital in the decaying city of Uroko \u2014 a place where local myths and distorted memories bleed into reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.poster.avif?t=1761324495\" width=960 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.webm?t=1761324495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/extras/3cb0f3a855b889a5e430bf7cb3da5f13.mp4?t=1761324495\" type=\