 and Kabuki \u2014 art forms that dwell on guilt, regret, and spiritual transgression.<br><br>While struggling to survive, Vanessa uncovers fragments of memories, records, and symbols, questioning her own role in the tragedy.<br>Is she a victim of Uroko\u2019s curse \u2014 or the reason it fell apart?","developers":["KAIZAKI"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/header.jpg?t=1761324495","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Sur: Wheelchair Horror","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dream Stories"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nMedo\nNudez","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/0d1c3e62b52b80dbb4b513ef564d62944fe92bbb/ss_0d1c3e62b52b80dbb4b513ef564d62944fe92bbb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761324495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263260/0d1c3e62b52b80dbb4b513ef564d62944fe92bbb/ss_0d1c3e62b52b80dbb4b513ef564d62944fe92bbb.600x338.jpg?t=1761324495"},{"id":1,"path_full":"htt